    Lists:
        @: l0 (("ifndef PCRE2_H_IDEMPOTENT_GUARD");("Function-like macro has no independent C symbol; role: runtime_operation.");("LMX::pcre2";"LMX::pcre2_posix");("Function-like macro has no independent C symbol; role: name_or_type_generator.");("ifndef PCRE2_H_IDEMPOTENT_GUARD";"else /* PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH is defined */";"if PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH == 8 || \\");("ifndef PCRE2_H_IDEMPOTENT_GUARD";"else /* PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH is defined */";"elif PCRE2_CODE_UNIT_WIDTH == 0");("Function-like macro has no independent C symbol; role: configuration_or_alias.");();("Alias has no independent addressable binary entry.";"Collection ABI namespace rewrite: PCRE2regcomp -> pcre2_regcomp. Use the generated public header from the CMake target.");("Alias has no independent addressable binary entry.";"Collection ABI namespace rewrite: PCRE2regerror -> pcre2_regerror. Use the generated public header from the CMake target.");("Alias has no independent addressable binary entry.";"Collection ABI namespace rewrite: PCRE2regexec -> pcre2_regexec. Use the generated public header from the CMake target.");("Alias has no independent addressable binary entry.";"Collection ABI namespace rewrite: PCRE2regfree -> pcre2_regfree. Use the generated public header from the CMake target.");("isolated header preprocessing; dependency includes masked");("The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.";"Callback parameter needs actor-owned trampoline/lifetime and exception translation.");("Callback parameter needs actor-owned trampoline/lifetime and exception translation.");("The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.");("Callback type/slot, not an exported callable.";"The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.";"JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.");("Callback type/slot, not an exported callable.";"JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.");("The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.";"JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.");("JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.");("The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.";"JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.";"Callback typedef parameter(s): pcre2_jit_callback_16. Use an actor-owned trampoline/lifetime contract.");("The delivered PCRE2 profile builds only the 8-bit library and POSIX facade. The header also declares 16/32-bit families; preserve their contracts without claiming those implementations are linked.";"JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may provide an error-returning JIT stub; presence of an exported name does not make JIT execution available.";"Callback typedef parameter(s): pcre2_jit_callback_32. Use an actor-owned trampoline/lifetime contract.");("JIT is disabled in this profile. Upstream may prov